    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/ae9e97e530f6f6d5b6cd7ff8764c2651.avif?t=1754603955\" width=800 height=374 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Goal of Sef Saga is to allow you to have many different choices from the start of the game. It is a project that is still being worked on by one developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sef Saga</strong> invites you to a truly open-ended roleplaying experience, a sandbox game where <strong>your destiny is yours to command</strong>. No two playthroughs are alike, thanks to a <strong>randomized world</strong> that guarantees fresh adventures every time, the life in this world is alive and creates a nice ecobalance for you to enjoy. With <strong>14 diverse skills</strong> to hone all the way to level 50.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/d3634335de6b4c77fde8021a6095c732.avif?t=1754603955\" data-has-big width=800 height=910 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you'll have ample opportunities to customize your character and playstyle. An innovative <strong>talking system</strong> allows for deep interaction with in-game entities, opening up a wealth of errands, quests, and narrative possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventures aren't limited to the surface; explore the depths by digging down, reaching the fiery realm of <strong>Magamada</strong> after two descents. Keep an eye out for the enigmatic <strong>Labyrinths</strong> that mysteriously appear in the desert, promising untold treasures to those brave enough to explore them. Embrace the life of a fierce <strong>Hunter</strong>, a peaceful <strong>farmer</strong>, or a cunning <strong>master trader </strong> \u2013 the path you choose is entirely up to you. This ongoing project is designed to offer unparalleled freedom and choice from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/242414c24777e88112ecbbcbff9554c0.avif?t=1754603955\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/ae9e97e530f6f6d5b6cd7ff8764c2651.avif?t=1754603955\" width=800 height=374 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Goal of Sef Saga is to allow you to have many different choices from the start of the game. It is a project that is still being worked on by one developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sef Saga</strong> invites you to a truly open-ended roleplaying experience, a sandbox game where <strong>your destiny is yours to command</strong>. No two playthroughs are alike, thanks to a <strong>randomized world</strong> that guarantees fresh adventures every time, the life in this world is alive and creates a nice ecobalance for you to enjoy. With <strong>14 diverse skills</strong> to hone all the way to level 50.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/d3634335de6b4c77fde8021a6095c732.avif?t=1754603955\" data-has-big width=800 height=910 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you'll have ample opportunities to customize your character and playstyle. An innovative <strong>talking system</strong> allows for deep interaction with in-game entities, opening up a wealth of errands, quests, and narrative possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventures aren't limited to the surface; explore the depths by digging down, reaching the fiery realm of <strong>Magamada</strong> after two descents. Keep an eye out for the enigmatic <strong>Labyrinths</strong> that mysteriously appear in the desert, promising untold treasures to those brave enough to explore them. Embrace the life of a fierce <strong>Hunter</strong>, a peaceful <strong>farmer</strong>, or a cunning <strong>master trader </strong> \u2013 the path you choose is entirely up to you. This ongoing project is designed to offer unparalleled freedom and choice from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820950/extras/242414c24777e88112ecbbcbff9554c0.avif?t=1754603955\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Shape your unique adventure in Sef Saga, a roleplaying sandbox, every game is different! Master 14 skills, talk to anyone, and forge your path. Explore above ground, delve to Magamada, or hunt for treasure in desert Labyrinths. Be a combatant, a farmer, or a trader and more \u2013 your destiny awaits.",
